---
layout: base.njk
permalink: /
---
<main>
<section class="hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div>
      <h1>Going back to the way granny did it.</h1>
      <p class="lede">I’m a mom helping other moms feed their families real food, clean up their homes, and slow down, without the overwhelm or the price tag.</p>
      <div class="actions">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="{{ site.mealPlanLink }}">Get the free meal plan</a>
        <a class="btn btn-quiet" href="/about/">Read my story</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <aside class="recipe-card" aria-label="Granny’s rules">
      <h2>Granny’s rules</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>We’re an ingredient family.</li>
        <li>Don’t guess, test.</li>
        <li>If it has fragrance, toss it.</li>
        <li>Skip the morning scroll.</li>
        <li>The dishes can wait.</li>
        <li>Jesus first, always.</li>
      </ul>
    </aside>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="gingham" aria-hidden="true"></div>

<section class="band">
  <div class="wrap freebie">
    <div>
      <h2>Start here: a free 7-day meal plan</h2>
      <p class="section-intro">Fresh-milled breakfasts, cook-once-eat-twice dinners, batch-cook recipes, and a full grocery list.</p>
    </div>
    <a class="btn btn-primary" href="{{ site.mealPlanLink }}">Send me the meal plan</a>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2>New in the kitchen</h2>
    <div class="grid">
      {% for t in collections.recipes | newest | limit(3) %}{% set kicker = t.data.category %}{% include "tile.njk" %}{% endfor %}
    </div>
    <p style="margin-top:1.5rem"><a href="/recipes/">See all recipes</a></p>
  </div>
</section>

<section style="background:var(--enamel-soft)">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2>From the journal</h2>
    <div class="posts">
      {% for p in collections.posts | newest | limit(3) %}
      <article class="post-row">
        <time datetime="{{ p.date | isoDate }}">{{ p.date | readableDate }}</time>
        <div><h3><a href="{{ p.url }}">{{ p.data.title }}</a></h3><p>{{ p.data.description }}</p></div>
      </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    <p><a href="/journal/">Read all posts</a></p>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2>Guides for your home and table</h2>
    <div class="shop">
      {% for s in collections.shop | byOrder | limit(3) %}
      <div class="product{% if s.data.status == 'Coming soon' %} soon{% endif %}">
        <h3>{{ s.data.title }}</h3>
        <p class="price">{{ s.data.price }}</p>
        <p>{{ s.data.description }}</p>
        <a class="btn {% if loop.first %}btn-primary{% else %}btn-quiet{% endif %}" href="{{ s.data.link }}">{{ s.data.buttonText }}</a>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    <p style="margin-top:1.5rem"><a href="/shop/">Visit the shop</a></p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2>Top picks from our home</h2>
    <p class="section-intro">Start with the free swaps first. These are for when you’re ready.</p>
    <div class="room picks" style="margin-top:2rem"><ul>
      {% for f in collections.favorites | byOrder %}{% if f.data.featured %}{% include "favorite.njk" %}{% endif %}{% endfor %}
    </ul></div>
    <p style="margin-top:2rem"><a class="btn btn-primary" style="background:var(--butter);color:var(--enamel);border-color:var(--butter)" href="/favorites/">See all my favorites</a></p>
  </div>
</section>
</main>
